    "prior_scientific_standing": "BOUNDED_ADMISSION",
    "prior_surviving_relation": "Within the tested five-node equal-shortest-route specimen, permuting competing first-hop edge_id labels while preserving the tested directed endpoint relation can change the selected coordinate path.",
